    "body": "## End-to-end work summary\nWhen a `fetch` or `run-check` is not covered by a grant and the Vault rule grants it at once (ref kept to the Paseo bot or to all bots), the same call now continues with the new grant: `fetch` sends the request, `run-check` returns the values. Before, the call wrote the grant and still answered exit 8. A ref that needs a person still answers exit 8 with a card; a missing ref and the rate limit are unchanged.\n\n## Subagent delegation\nNone. Subagents were not available in this environment.\n\n## Technical decisions\n- `evaluate` in `server/secrets/service.ts` returns `covered` with the new grant for release calls (`fetch`, `run-check`, ordinary release). The plain `request` call still returns `granted` and releases nothing.\n- The approval audit row (`auto:paseo-scoped`) is written before the grant is made, so it comes before any value is read. The release row follows. The Inbox line, the \"by OMB\" notice and the rate-limit count are untouched.\n- The auto-grant has no host list, so the host check is not skipped: `fetch` still checks the secret's allowed hosts before `evaluate`.\n- The \"approved it for 24 hours just now, run again\" messages were dead code and are removed. The client text in `bin/omb.mjs` and `skills/omb-vault/SKILL.md` (kept byte-equal) now says exit 8 means a card is waiting.\n\n## Deviations from plan\nNone. One test (exec scope) now expects each new scope to get its own auto grant, instead of exit 8.\n\n## Completion evidence\n- `npx vitest run server/secrets server/routes/secrets.test.ts`: 288 passed.\n- `npx oxlint --deny-warnings` on the changed paths: clean.\n- `npx tsc -p tsconfig.server.json --noEmit`: clean.\n- New or changed tests: fetch and release succeed in one call with audit, history and notice; audit approval row precedes the release row; run-check with one auto ref and one person ref answers 8 and opens a card; person-decided still answers 8; an existing grant is unchanged.\n\n## Checklist\n- [x] Auto-granted fetch and run-check succeed in one call\n- [x] Audit row before the value, Inbox line, notice, rate limit kept\n- [x] Person-decided and missing-ref paths still exit 8 with a card\n- [x] docs/omb-secrets-api.md, docs/omb-cli.md, skill text updated\n- [x] Tests, lint, typecheck\n\n## Human actions required\nReview and merge. Agents on an old `omb` client are unaffected; they only see fewer exit 8 answers.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
